,"/arc-plc/oklahoma/woods-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, February to March ran 22% of normal on the middle and August to September ran 190%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 38% of normal on the middle and April to May at 42%.</p>"}
